  ('v3_below_value_condition_occupancy', 'lc-v3-bvco-ar-1', 'v3_below_value_condition_occupancy — Arabic (seller conversation v3)', 'Arabic', 'شكراً، قد يكون ذلك مناسباً. سؤالان سريعان: ما حالة العقار، وهل يسكن فيه أحد حالياً؟', 'Thanks, that could work. Two quick things: what shape is the place in, and is anyone living there right now?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Below-Value Condition + Occupancy', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_below_value_condition_occupancy', 'lc-v3-bvco-ru-1', 'v3_below_value_condition_occupancy — Russian (seller conversation v3)', 'Russian', 'Спасибо, это может подойти. Два коротких вопроса: в каком состоянии дом и живёт ли там сейчас кто-нибудь?', 'Thanks, that could work. Two quick things: what shape is the place in, and is anyone living there right now?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Below-Value Condition + Occupancy', true, 'new_use_case'),
