  ('v3_reask_ownership', 'lc-v3-rao-zh-1', 'v3_reask_ownership — Mandarin (seller conversation v3)', 'Mandarin', '不好意思，我只是想确认一下没找错人。请问您是这处房产的业主吗？', 'Sorry, just want to make sure I have the right person. Are you the owner of the property?', 'S1', 'Stage 1 Re-ask Ownership (once)', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_reask_ownership', 'lc-v3-rao-ko-1', 'v3_reask_ownership — Korean (seller conversation v3)', 'Korean', '죄송합니다, 제가 맞는 분께 연락드린 건지 확인하고 싶어서요. 이 부동산의 소유주이신가요?', 'Sorry, just want to make sure I have the right person. Are you the owner of the property?', 'S1', 'Stage 1 Re-ask Ownership (once)', true, 'new_use_case'),
