  ('v3_reask_interest', 'lc-v3-rai-hi-1', 'v3_reask_interest — Indian (Hindi or Other) (seller conversation v3)', 'Indian (Hindi or Other)', 'कोई बात नहीं। बस पूछ रहा हूँ, अगर आंकड़े ठीक बैठें तो क्या आप प्रॉपर्टी पर किसी ऑफ़र के लिए तैयार होंगे?', 'No worries. Just to check, would you be open to an offer on the property if the numbers made sense?', 'S2', 'Stage 2 Re-ask Interest (once)', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_who_is_this_variant', 'lc-v3-wisv-en-1', 'v3_who_is_this_variant — English (seller conversation v3)', 'English', 'Sure. I''m Alex, a local investor. I buy a few houses around here each year and came across yours in the public records. Would you be open to a proposal?', null, 'S2', 'Who Is This — second answer (variant)', false, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_who_is_this_variant', 'lc-v3-wisv-es-1', 'v3_who_is_this_variant — Spanish (seller conversation v3)', 'Spanish', 'Claro. Soy Alex, un inversionista local. Compro algunas casas por aquí cada año y vi la suya en los registros públicos. ¿Estaría abierto a una propuesta?', 'Sure. I''m Alex, a local investor. I buy a few houses around here each year and came across yours in the public records. Would you be open to a proposal?', 'S2', 'Who Is This — second answer (variant)', false, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_who_is_this_variant', 'lc-v3-wisv-pt-1', 'v3_who_is_this_variant — Portuguese (seller conversation v3)', 'Portuguese', 'Claro. Sou o Alex, investidor local. Compro algumas casas por aqui todo ano e encontrei a sua nos registros públicos. Estaria aberto a uma proposta?', 'Sure. I''m Alex, a local investor. I buy a few houses around here each year and came across yours in the public records. Would you be open to a proposal?', 'S2', 'Who Is This — second answer (variant)', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_who_is_this_variant', 'lc-v3-wisv-fr-1', 'v3_who_is_this_variant — French (seller conversation v3)', 'French', 'Bien sûr. Je suis Alex, un investisseur du coin. J''achète quelques maisons par ici chaque année et je suis tombé sur la vôtre dans les registres publics. Seriez-vous ouvert à une proposition ?', 'Sure. I''m Alex, a local investor. I buy a few houses around here each year and came across yours in the public records. Would you be open to a proposal?', 'S2', 'Who Is This — second answer (variant)', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_who_is_this_variant', 'lc-v3-wisv-de-1', 'v3_who_is_this_variant — German (seller conversation v3)', 'German', 'Klar. Ich bin Alex, ein lokaler Investor. Ich kaufe hier jedes Jahr ein paar Häuser und bin in den öffentlichen Registern auf Ihres gestoßen. Wären Sie offen für ein Angebot?', 'Sure. I''m Alex, a local investor. I buy a few houses around here each year and came across yours in the public records. Would you be open to a proposal?', 'S2', 'Who Is This — second answer (variant)', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_who_is_this_variant', 'lc-v3-wisv-it-1', 'v3_who_is_this_variant — Italian (seller conversation v3)', 'Italian', 'Certo. Sono Alex, un investitore della zona. Compro qualche casa qui ogni anno e ho trovato la sua nei registri pubblici. Sarebbe aperto a una proposta?', 'Sure. I''m Alex, a local investor. I buy a few houses around here each year and came across yours in the public records. Would you be open to a proposal?', 'S2', 'Who Is This — second answer (variant)', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_who_is_this_variant', 'lc-v3-wisv-pl-1', 'v3_who_is_this_variant — Polish (seller conversation v3)', 'Polish', 'Jasne. Jestem Alex, lokalny inwestor. Co roku kupuję tu kilka domów i znalazłem Pana nieruchomość w rejestrach publicznych. Czy byłby Pan otwarty na propozycję?', 'Sure. I''m Alex, a local investor. I buy a few houses around here each year and came across yours in the public records. Would you be open to a proposal?', 'S2', 'Who Is This — second answer (variant)', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_who_is_this_variant', 'lc-v3-wisv-vi-1', 'v3_who_is_this_variant — Vietnamese (seller conversation v3)', 'Vietnamese', 'Dạ vâng. Tôi là Alex, một nhà đầu tư ở địa phương. Mỗi năm tôi mua vài căn nhà quanh đây và thấy nhà của anh/chị trong hồ sơ công khai. Anh/chị có sẵn lòng nghe một đề nghị không?', 'Sure. I''m Alex, a local investor. I buy a few houses around here each year and came across yours in the public records. Would you be open to a proposal?', 'S2', 'Who Is This — second answer (variant)', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_who_is_this_variant', 'lc-v3-wisv-zh-1', 'v3_who_is_this_variant — Mandarin (seller conversation v3)', 'Mandarin', '当然。我是Alex，本地的投资人。我每年在这一带买几套房子，在公开记录里看到了您的房子。您愿意听听报价吗？', 'Sure. I''m Alex, a local investor. I buy a few houses around here each year and came across yours in the public records. Would you be open to a proposal?', 'S2', 'Who Is This — second answer (variant)', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_who_is_this_variant', 'lc-v3-wisv-ko-1', 'v3_who_is_this_variant — Korean (seller conversation v3)', 'Korean', '네. 저는 이 지역 투자자 Alex입니다. 매년 이 근처에서 집을 몇 채씩 사는데, 공공 기록에서 이 집을 보게 됐습니다. 제안을 들어 보실 의향이 있으신가요?', 'Sure. I''m Alex, a local investor. I buy a few houses around here each year and came across yours in the public records. Would you be open to a proposal?', 'S2', 'Who Is This — second answer (variant)', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_who_is_this_variant', 'lc-v3-wisv-ja-1', 'v3_who_is_this_variant — Japanese (seller conversation v3)', 'Japanese', 'はい。地元の投資家のAlexです。毎年この辺りで何軒か家を購入していて、公開記録でお宅を拝見しました。ご提案を聞いていただけますか？', 'Sure. I''m Alex, a local investor. I buy a few houses around here each year and came across yours in the public records. Would you be open to a proposal?', 'S2', 'Who Is This — second answer (variant)', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_who_is_this_variant', 'lc-v3-wisv-he-1', 'v3_who_is_this_variant — Hebrew (seller conversation v3)', 'Hebrew', 'בטח. אני אלכס, משקיע מקומי. אני קונה כמה בתים באזור כל שנה ונתקלתי בנכס שלך ברשומות הציבוריות. היית פתוח להצעה?', 'Sure. I''m Alex, a local investor. I buy a few houses around here each year and came across yours in the public records. Would you be open to a proposal?', 'S2', 'Who Is This — second answer (variant)', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_who_is_this_variant', 'lc-v3-wisv-ar-1', 'v3_who_is_this_variant — Arabic (seller conversation v3)', 'Arabic', 'بالتأكيد. أنا أليكس، مستثمر محلي. أشتري بعض البيوت في هذه المنطقة كل عام ووجدت بيتك في السجلات العامة. هل أنت منفتح على عرض؟', 'Sure. I''m Alex, a local investor. I buy a few houses around here each year and came across yours in the public records. Would you be open to a proposal?', 'S2', 'Who Is This — second answer (variant)', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_who_is_this_variant', 'lc-v3-wisv-ru-1', 'v3_who_is_this_variant — Russian (seller conversation v3)', 'Russian', 'Конечно. Я Алекс, местный инвестор. Каждый год покупаю здесь несколько домов и увидел ваш в открытых реестрах. Вы бы рассмотрели предложение?', 'Sure. I''m Alex, a local investor. I buy a few houses around here each year and came across yours in the public records. Would you be open to a proposal?', 'S2', 'Who Is This — second answer (variant)', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_who_is_this_variant', 'lc-v3-wisv-el-1', 'v3_who_is_this_variant — Greek (seller conversation v3)', 'Greek', 'Βεβαίως. Είμαι ο Alex, τοπικός επενδυτής. Αγοράζω μερικά σπίτια εδώ κάθε χρόνο και βρήκα το δικό σας στα δημόσια αρχεία. Θα ήσασταν ανοιχτός σε μια πρόταση;', 'Sure. I''m Alex, a local investor. I buy a few houses around here each year and came across yours in the public records. Would you be open to a proposal?', 'S2', 'Who Is This — second answer (variant)', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_who_is_this_variant', 'lc-v3-wisv-hi-1', 'v3_who_is_this_variant — Indian (Hindi or Other) (seller conversation v3)', 'Indian (Hindi or Other)', 'ज़रूर। मैं Alex हूँ, एक स्थानीय निवेशक। मैं हर साल यहाँ कुछ घर खरीदता हूँ और सार्वजनिक रिकॉर्ड में आपकी प्रॉपर्टी देखी। क्या आप एक प्रस्ताव सुनना चाहेंगे?', 'Sure. I''m Alex, a local investor. I buy a few houses around here each year and came across yours in the public records. Would you be open to a proposal?', 'S2', 'Who Is This — second answer (variant)', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_numbers_pending', 'lc-v3-nump-en-1', 'v3_numbers_pending — English (seller conversation v3)', 'English', 'Thanks, that helps a lot. Let me run the numbers and I''ll get back to you shortly.', null, 'S4', 'Stage 4 Checklist Complete — Numbers Pending', false, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_numbers_pending', 'lc-v3-nump-es-1', 'v3_numbers_pending — Spanish (seller conversation v3)', 'Spanish', 'Gracias, eso me ayuda mucho. Déjeme sacar los números y le escribo en breve.', 'Thanks, that helps a lot. Let me run the numbers and I''ll get back to you shortly.', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Checklist Complete — Numbers Pending', false, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_numbers_pending', 'lc-v3-nump-pt-1', 'v3_numbers_pending — Portuguese (seller conversation v3)', 'Portuguese', 'Obrigado, isso ajuda bastante. Vou fazer as contas e te retorno em breve.', 'Thanks, that helps a lot. Let me run the numbers and I''ll get back to you shortly.', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Checklist Complete — Numbers Pending', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_numbers_pending', 'lc-v3-nump-fr-1', 'v3_numbers_pending — French (seller conversation v3)', 'French', 'Merci, ça m''aide beaucoup. Je fais les calculs et je reviens vers vous rapidement.', 'Thanks, that helps a lot. Let me run the numbers and I''ll get back to you shortly.', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Checklist Complete — Numbers Pending', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_numbers_pending', 'lc-v3-nump-de-1', 'v3_numbers_pending — German (seller conversation v3)', 'German', 'Danke, das hilft sehr. Ich rechne das kurz durch und melde mich bald wieder.', 'Thanks, that helps a lot. Let me run the numbers and I''ll get back to you shortly.', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Checklist Complete — Numbers Pending', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_numbers_pending', 'lc-v3-nump-it-1', 'v3_numbers_pending — Italian (seller conversation v3)', 'Italian', 'Grazie, mi è molto utile. Faccio due conti e le riscrivo a breve.', 'Thanks, that helps a lot. Let me run the numbers and I''ll get back to you shortly.', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Checklist Complete — Numbers Pending', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_numbers_pending', 'lc-v3-nump-pl-1', 'v3_numbers_pending — Polish (seller conversation v3)', 'Polish', 'Dzięki, to bardzo pomaga. Przeliczę wszystko i wkrótce się odezwę.', 'Thanks, that helps a lot. Let me run the numbers and I''ll get back to you shortly.', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Checklist Complete — Numbers Pending', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_numbers_pending', 'lc-v3-nump-vi-1', 'v3_numbers_pending — Vietnamese (seller conversation v3)', 'Vietnamese', 'Cảm ơn, thông tin này rất hữu ích. Để tôi tính toán và sẽ báo lại anh/chị sớm.', 'Thanks, that helps a lot. Let me run the numbers and I''ll get back to you shortly.', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Checklist Complete — Numbers Pending', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_numbers_pending', 'lc-v3-nump-zh-1', 'v3_numbers_pending — Mandarin (seller conversation v3)', 'Mandarin', '谢谢，这很有帮助。我算一下，很快回复您。', 'Thanks, that helps a lot. Let me run the numbers and I''ll get back to you shortly.', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Checklist Complete — Numbers Pending', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_numbers_pending', 'lc-v3-nump-ko-1', 'v3_numbers_pending — Korean (seller conversation v3)', 'Korean', '감사합니다, 큰 도움이 됐어요. 계산해 보고 곧 다시 연락드릴게요.', 'Thanks, that helps a lot. Let me run the numbers and I''ll get back to you shortly.', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Checklist Complete — Numbers Pending', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_numbers_pending', 'lc-v3-nump-ja-1', 'v3_numbers_pending — Japanese (seller conversation v3)', 'Japanese', 'ありがとうございます、とても助かります。計算してみて、すぐにまたご連絡します。', 'Thanks, that helps a lot. Let me run the numbers and I''ll get back to you shortly.', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Checklist Complete — Numbers Pending', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_numbers_pending', 'lc-v3-nump-he-1', 'v3_numbers_pending — Hebrew (seller conversation v3)', 'Hebrew', 'תודה, זה עוזר מאוד. אעשה את החישובים ואחזור אליך בקרוב.', 'Thanks, that helps a lot. Let me run the numbers and I''ll get back to you shortly.', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Checklist Complete — Numbers Pending', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_numbers_pending', 'lc-v3-nump-ar-1', 'v3_numbers_pending — Arabic (seller conversation v3)', 'Arabic', 'شكراً، هذا يساعد كثيراً. سأحسب الأرقام وأعود إليك قريباً.', 'Thanks, that helps a lot. Let me run the numbers and I''ll get back to you shortly.', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Checklist Complete — Numbers Pending', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_numbers_pending', 'lc-v3-nump-ru-1', 'v3_numbers_pending — Russian (seller conversation v3)', 'Russian', 'Спасибо, это очень помогает. Посчитаю цифры и скоро вернусь к вам.', 'Thanks, that helps a lot. Let me run the numbers and I''ll get back to you shortly.', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Checklist Complete — Numbers Pending', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_numbers_pending', 'lc-v3-nump-el-1', 'v3_numbers_pending — Greek (seller conversation v3)', 'Greek', 'Ευχαριστώ, αυτό βοηθάει πολύ. Θα κάνω τους υπολογισμούς και θα επανέλθω σύντομα.', 'Thanks, that helps a lot. Let me run the numbers and I''ll get back to you shortly.', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Checklist Complete — Numbers Pending', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_numbers_pending', 'lc-v3-nump-hi-1', 'v3_numbers_pending — Indian (Hindi or Other) (seller conversation v3)', 'Indian (Hindi or Other)', 'धन्यवाद, इससे बहुत मदद मिली। मैं हिसाब लगाकर जल्द ही आपको बताता हूँ।', 'Thanks, that helps a lot. Let me run the numbers and I''ll get back to you shortly.', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Checklist Complete — Numbers Pending', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_update_year_follow_up', 'lc-v3-upy-en-1', 'v3_update_year_follow_up — English (seller conversation v3)', 'English', 'Good to hear. Roughly when were the kitchen, baths and roof last updated?', null, 'S4', 'Stage 4 Update-Year Follow-up (once)', false, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_update_year_follow_up', 'lc-v3-upy-es-1', 'v3_update_year_follow_up — Spanish (seller conversation v3)', 'Spanish', 'Qué bueno. ¿Más o menos cuándo se actualizaron por última vez la cocina, los baños y el techo?', 'Good to hear. Roughly when were the kitchen, baths and roof last updated?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Update-Year Follow-up (once)', false, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_update_year_follow_up', 'lc-v3-upy-pt-1', 'v3_update_year_follow_up — Portuguese (seller conversation v3)', 'Portuguese', 'Que bom. Mais ou menos quando a cozinha, os banheiros e o telhado foram reformados pela última vez?', 'Good to hear. Roughly when were the kitchen, baths and roof last updated?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Update-Year Follow-up (once)', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_update_year_follow_up', 'lc-v3-upy-fr-1', 'v3_update_year_follow_up — French (seller conversation v3)', 'French', 'Bonne nouvelle. À peu près quand la cuisine, les salles de bain et le toit ont-ils été refaits pour la dernière fois ?', 'Good to hear. Roughly when were the kitchen, baths and roof last updated?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Update-Year Follow-up (once)', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_update_year_follow_up', 'lc-v3-upy-de-1', 'v3_update_year_follow_up — German (seller conversation v3)', 'German', 'Gut zu hören. Ungefähr wann wurden Küche, Bäder und Dach zuletzt erneuert?', 'Good to hear. Roughly when were the kitchen, baths and roof last updated?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Update-Year Follow-up (once)', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_update_year_follow_up', 'lc-v3-upy-it-1', 'v3_update_year_follow_up — Italian (seller conversation v3)', 'Italian', 'Bene. Più o meno quando sono stati rifatti l''ultima volta cucina, bagni e tetto?', 'Good to hear. Roughly when were the kitchen, baths and roof last updated?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Update-Year Follow-up (once)', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_update_year_follow_up', 'lc-v3-upy-pl-1', 'v3_update_year_follow_up — Polish (seller conversation v3)', 'Polish', 'Dobrze słyszeć. Mniej więcej kiedy ostatnio remontowano kuchnię, łazienki i dach?', 'Good to hear. Roughly when were the kitchen, baths and roof last updated?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Update-Year Follow-up (once)', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_update_year_follow_up', 'lc-v3-upy-vi-1', 'v3_update_year_follow_up — Vietnamese (seller conversation v3)', 'Vietnamese', 'Tốt quá. Khoảng khi nào bếp, phòng tắm và mái nhà được sửa mới lần gần nhất?', 'Good to hear. Roughly when were the kitchen, baths and roof last updated?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Update-Year Follow-up (once)', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_update_year_follow_up', 'lc-v3-upy-zh-1', 'v3_update_year_follow_up — Mandarin (seller conversation v3)', 'Mandarin', '那挺好。厨房、卫生间和屋顶大概是什么时候最后翻新的？', 'Good to hear. Roughly when were the kitchen, baths and roof last updated?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Update-Year Follow-up (once)', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_update_year_follow_up', 'lc-v3-upy-ko-1', 'v3_update_year_follow_up — Korean (seller conversation v3)', 'Korean', '다행이네요. 주방, 욕실, 지붕은 대략 언제 마지막으로 수리하셨나요?', 'Good to hear. Roughly when were the kitchen, baths and roof last updated?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Update-Year Follow-up (once)', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_update_year_follow_up', 'lc-v3-upy-ja-1', 'v3_update_year_follow_up — Japanese (seller conversation v3)', 'Japanese', 'それは良かったです。キッチン、浴室、屋根は最後にいつ頃リフォームされましたか？', 'Good to hear. Roughly when were the kitchen, baths and roof last updated?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Update-Year Follow-up (once)', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_update_year_follow_up', 'lc-v3-upy-he-1', 'v3_update_year_follow_up — Hebrew (seller conversation v3)', 'Hebrew', 'טוב לשמוע. בערך מתי שופצו לאחרונה המטבח, חדרי הרחצה והגג?', 'Good to hear. Roughly when were the kitchen, baths and roof last updated?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Update-Year Follow-up (once)', true, 'new_use_case'),
