  ('v3_update_year_follow_up', 'lc-v3-upy-ru-1', 'v3_update_year_follow_up — Russian (seller conversation v3)', 'Russian', 'Хорошо. Примерно когда последний раз обновляли кухню, ванные и крышу?', 'Good to hear. Roughly when were the kitchen, baths and roof last updated?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Update-Year Follow-up (once)', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_update_year_follow_up', 'lc-v3-upy-el-1', 'v3_update_year_follow_up — Greek (seller conversation v3)', 'Greek', 'Χαίρομαι. Περίπου πότε ανακαινίστηκαν τελευταία φορά η κουζίνα, τα μπάνια και η στέγη;', 'Good to hear. Roughly when were the kitchen, baths and roof last updated?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Update-Year Follow-up (once)', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_update_year_follow_up', 'lc-v3-upy-hi-1', 'v3_update_year_follow_up — Indian (Hindi or Other) (seller conversation v3)', 'Indian (Hindi or Other)', 'अच्छी बात है। किचन, बाथरूम और छत आख़िरी बार लगभग कब अपडेट हुए थे?', 'Good to hear. Roughly when were the kitchen, baths and roof last updated?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Update-Year Follow-up (once)', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_mf_per_door_anchor', 'lc-v3-mfpd-en-1', 'v3_mf_per_door_anchor — English (seller conversation v3)', 'English', 'Thanks. Similar buildings nearby are trading around {{per_door_low}} to {{per_door_high}} a door, so I''d likely be somewhere in that range. Would that work for you?', null, 'S5', 'Stage 5 Multifamily Per-Door Anchor', false, 'new_use_case'),
