  ('v3_mf_per_door_anchor', 'lc-v3-mfpd-pl-1', 'v3_mf_per_door_anchor — Polish (seller conversation v3)', 'Polish', 'Dzięki. Podobne budynki w okolicy sprzedają się za około {{per_door_low}}–{{per_door_high}} za lokal, więc byłbym mniej więcej w tym przedziale. Czy to by Panu pasowało?', 'Thanks. Similar buildings nearby are trading around {{per_door_low}} to {{per_door_high}} a door, so I''d likely be somewhere in that range. Would that work for you?', 'S5', 'Stage 5 Multifamily Per-Door Anchor', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_mf_per_door_anchor', 'lc-v3-mfpd-vi-1', 'v3_mf_per_door_anchor — Vietnamese (seller conversation v3)', 'Vietnamese', 'Cảm ơn. Các tòa nhà tương tự gần đây đang bán khoảng {{per_door_low}} đến {{per_door_high}} mỗi căn hộ, nên tôi có lẽ sẽ ở trong khoảng đó. Như vậy có được không?', 'Thanks. Similar buildings nearby are trading around {{per_door_low}} to {{per_door_high}} a door, so I''d likely be somewhere in that range. Would that work for you?', 'S5', 'Stage 5 Multifamily Per-Door Anchor', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_mf_per_door_anchor', 'lc-v3-mfpd-zh-1', 'v3_mf_per_door_anchor — Mandarin (seller conversation v3)', 'Mandarin', '谢谢。附近类似的楼每个单元大约成交在{{per_door_low}}到{{per_door_high}}，所以我的报价大概会在这个范围。您觉得可以吗？', 'Thanks. Similar buildings nearby are trading around {{per_door_low}} to {{per_door_high}} a door, so I''d likely be somewhere in that range. Would that work for you?', 'S5', 'Stage 5 Multifamily Per-Door Anchor', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_mf_per_door_anchor', 'lc-v3-mfpd-ko-1', 'v3_mf_per_door_anchor — Korean (seller conversation v3)', 'Korean', '감사합니다. 근처 비슷한 건물들이 세대당 {{per_door_low}}에서 {{per_door_high}} 정도에 거래되고 있어서, 저도 그 범위 안에서 생각하고 있습니다. 괜찮으실까요?', 'Thanks. Similar buildings nearby are trading around {{per_door_low}} to {{per_door_high}} a door, so I''d likely be somewhere in that range. Would that work for you?', 'S5', 'Stage 5 Multifamily Per-Door Anchor', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_mf_per_door_anchor', 'lc-v3-mfpd-ja-1', 'v3_mf_per_door_anchor — Japanese (seller conversation v3)', 'Japanese', 'ありがとうございます。近くの似た建物は1戸あたり{{per_door_low}}から{{per_door_high}}ほどで取引されているので、私もその範囲になると思います。いかがでしょうか？', 'Thanks. Similar buildings nearby are trading around {{per_door_low}} to {{per_door_high}} a door, so I''d likely be somewhere in that range. Would that work for you?', 'S5', 'Stage 5 Multifamily Per-Door Anchor', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_mf_per_door_anchor', 'lc-v3-mfpd-he-1', 'v3_mf_per_door_anchor — Hebrew (seller conversation v3)', 'Hebrew', 'תודה. בניינים דומים באזור נמכרים בערך ב-{{per_door_low}} עד {{per_door_high}} ליחידה, אז כנראה שאהיה בטווח הזה. זה יכול להתאים לך?', 'Thanks. Similar buildings nearby are trading around {{per_door_low}} to {{per_door_high}} a door, so I''d likely be somewhere in that range. Would that work for you?', 'S5', 'Stage 5 Multifamily Per-Door Anchor', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_mf_per_door_anchor', 'lc-v3-mfpd-ar-1', 'v3_mf_per_door_anchor — Arabic (seller conversation v3)', 'Arabic', 'شكراً. المباني المشابهة القريبة تُباع بحوالي {{per_door_low}} إلى {{per_door_high}} للوحدة، لذلك سأكون على الأرجح ضمن هذا النطاق. هل يناسبك ذلك؟', 'Thanks. Similar buildings nearby are trading around {{per_door_low}} to {{per_door_high}} a door, so I''d likely be somewhere in that range. Would that work for you?', 'S5', 'Stage 5 Multifamily Per-Door Anchor', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_mf_per_door_anchor', 'lc-v3-mfpd-ru-1', 'v3_mf_per_door_anchor — Russian (seller conversation v3)', 'Russian', 'Спасибо. Похожие дома рядом продаются примерно по {{per_door_low}}–{{per_door_high}} за квартиру, так что я, скорее всего, буду в этом диапазоне. Вам это подходит?', 'Thanks. Similar buildings nearby are trading around {{per_door_low}} to {{per_door_high}} a door, so I''d likely be somewhere in that range. Would that work for you?', 'S5', 'Stage 5 Multifamily Per-Door Anchor', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_mf_per_door_anchor', 'lc-v3-mfpd-el-1', 'v3_mf_per_door_anchor — Greek (seller conversation v3)', 'Greek', 'Ευχαριστώ. Παρόμοια κτίρια κοντά πωλούνται περίπου {{per_door_low}} έως {{per_door_high}} ανά διαμέρισμα, οπότε μάλλον θα είμαι σε αυτό το εύρος. Σας ταιριάζει;', 'Thanks. Similar buildings nearby are trading around {{per_door_low}} to {{per_door_high}} a door, so I''d likely be somewhere in that range. Would that work for you?', 'S5', 'Stage 5 Multifamily Per-Door Anchor', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('v3_mf_per_door_anchor', 'lc-v3-mfpd-hi-1', 'v3_mf_per_door_anchor — Indian (Hindi or Other) (seller conversation v3)', 'Indian (Hindi or Other)', 'धन्यवाद। आस-पास की मिलती-जुलती बिल्डिंगें प्रति यूनिट लगभग {{per_door_low}} से {{per_door_high}} में बिक रही हैं, तो मैं शायद इसी दायरे में रहूँगा। क्या यह आपके लिए ठीक रहेगा?', 'Thanks. Similar buildings nearby are trading around {{per_door_low}} to {{per_door_high}} a door, so I''d likely be somewhere in that range. Would that work for you?', 'S5', 'Stage 5 Multifamily Per-Door Anchor', true, 'new_use_case'),
  ('ask_condition_clarifier', 'lc-v3m-accl-pt-1', 'ask_condition_clarifier — Portuguese (seller conversation v3)', 'Portuguese', 'Obrigado, pode me contar um pouco mais sobre o estado do imóvel? Algo grande como telhado, ar-condicionado ou fundação?', 'Thanks, could you tell me a little more about the condition? Anything major like roof, HVAC, or foundation?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Condition Clarifier', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('ask_condition_clarifier', 'lc-v3m-accl-fr-1', 'ask_condition_clarifier — French (seller conversation v3)', 'French', 'Merci, pouvez-vous m''en dire un peu plus sur l''état du bien ? Quelque chose d''important comme le toit, le chauffage/clim ou les fondations ?', 'Thanks, could you tell me a little more about the condition? Anything major like roof, HVAC, or foundation?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Condition Clarifier', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('ask_condition_clarifier', 'lc-v3m-accl-de-1', 'ask_condition_clarifier — German (seller conversation v3)', 'German', 'Danke, können Sie mir etwas mehr zum Zustand sagen? Irgendetwas Größeres wie Dach, Heizung/Klima oder Fundament?', 'Thanks, could you tell me a little more about the condition? Anything major like roof, HVAC, or foundation?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Condition Clarifier', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('ask_condition_clarifier', 'lc-v3m-accl-it-1', 'ask_condition_clarifier — Italian (seller conversation v3)', 'Italian', 'Grazie, può dirmi qualcosa in più sulle condizioni? Qualcosa di importante come tetto, impianto di climatizzazione o fondamenta?', 'Thanks, could you tell me a little more about the condition? Anything major like roof, HVAC, or foundation?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Condition Clarifier', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('ask_condition_clarifier', 'lc-v3m-accl-pl-1', 'ask_condition_clarifier — Polish (seller conversation v3)', 'Polish', 'Dzięki, może Pan powiedzieć coś więcej o stanie? Coś poważnego, jak dach, ogrzewanie/klimatyzacja albo fundamenty?', 'Thanks, could you tell me a little more about the condition? Anything major like roof, HVAC, or foundation?', 'S4', 'Stage 4 Condition Clarifier', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('seller_frustration_apology', 'lc-v3m-sfa-pt-1', 'seller_frustration_apology — Portuguese (seller conversation v3)', 'Portuguese', 'Desculpe por isso, vou anotar. Obrigado por avisar.', 'Sorry about that, I''ll note it. Thanks for letting me know.', null, 'Frustration Apology', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('seller_frustration_apology', 'lc-v3m-sfa-fr-1', 'seller_frustration_apology — French (seller conversation v3)', 'French', 'Désolé pour ça, je le note. Merci de me l''avoir dit.', 'Sorry about that, I''ll note it. Thanks for letting me know.', null, 'Frustration Apology', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('seller_frustration_apology', 'lc-v3m-sfa-de-1', 'seller_frustration_apology — German (seller conversation v3)', 'German', 'Entschuldigung, ich notiere es mir. Danke für den Hinweis.', 'Sorry about that, I''ll note it. Thanks for letting me know.', null, 'Frustration Apology', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('seller_frustration_apology', 'lc-v3m-sfa-it-1', 'seller_frustration_apology — Italian (seller conversation v3)', 'Italian', 'Mi scusi, me lo segno. Grazie per avermelo detto.', 'Sorry about that, I''ll note it. Thanks for letting me know.', null, 'Frustration Apology', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('seller_frustration_apology', 'lc-v3m-sfa-pl-1', 'seller_frustration_apology — Polish (seller conversation v3)', 'Polish', 'Przepraszam, zanotuję to. Dzięki, że dał Pan znać.', 'Sorry about that, I''ll note it. Thanks for letting me know.', null, 'Frustration Apology', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('not_interested', 'lc-v3m-ni-fr-1', 'not_interested — French (seller conversation v3)', 'French', 'Compris, je n''insiste pas. Si ça change un jour, voulez-vous que je reprenne contact plus tard ?', 'Understood, I''ll leave it alone. If that ever changes, want me to check back down the road?', 'SP', 'Not Interested (30-day nurture)', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('not_interested', 'lc-v3m-ni-de-1', 'not_interested — German (seller conversation v3)', 'German', 'Verstanden, dann lasse ich es. Falls sich das mal ändert, soll ich mich später noch einmal melden?', 'Understood, I''ll leave it alone. If that ever changes, want me to check back down the road?', 'SP', 'Not Interested (30-day nurture)', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('not_interested', 'lc-v3m-ni-it-1', 'not_interested — Italian (seller conversation v3)', 'Italian', 'Capito, non insisto. Se un giorno cambiasse idea, vuole che la ricontatti più avanti?', 'Understood, I''ll leave it alone. If that ever changes, want me to check back down the road?', 'SP', 'Not Interested (30-day nurture)', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('not_interested', 'lc-v3m-ni-pl-1', 'not_interested — Polish (seller conversation v3)', 'Polish', 'Rozumiem, nie będę naciskać. Gdyby to się kiedyś zmieniło, czy mogę odezwać się później?', 'Understood, I''ll leave it alone. If that ever changes, want me to check back down the road?', 'SP', 'Not Interested (30-day nurture)', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('already_listed', 'lc-v3m-al-pt-1', 'already_listed — Portuguese (seller conversation v3)', 'Portuguese', 'Entendido, não quero atrapalhar o seu anúncio. Se não vender, gostaria de uma oferta em dinheiro?', 'Understood, I won''t step on your listing. If it doesn''t sell, would you want a cash offer then?', 'SP', 'Already Listed (ack then nurture)', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('already_listed', 'lc-v3m-al-fr-1', 'already_listed — French (seller conversation v3)', 'French', 'Compris, je ne veux pas gêner votre mise en vente. Si ça ne se vend pas, seriez-vous intéressé par une offre comptant ?', 'Understood, I won''t step on your listing. If it doesn''t sell, would you want a cash offer then?', 'SP', 'Already Listed (ack then nurture)', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('already_listed', 'lc-v3m-al-de-1', 'already_listed — German (seller conversation v3)', 'German', 'Verstanden, ich will Ihrem Inserat nicht in die Quere kommen. Falls es nicht verkauft wird, wäre dann ein Barangebot interessant?', 'Understood, I won''t step on your listing. If it doesn''t sell, would you want a cash offer then?', 'SP', 'Already Listed (ack then nurture)', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('already_listed', 'lc-v3m-al-it-1', 'already_listed — Italian (seller conversation v3)', 'Italian', 'Capito, non voglio intralciare il suo annuncio. Se non si vende, le interesserebbe un''offerta in contanti?', 'Understood, I won''t step on your listing. If it doesn''t sell, would you want a cash offer then?', 'SP', 'Already Listed (ack then nurture)', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('already_listed', 'lc-v3m-al-pl-1', 'already_listed — Polish (seller conversation v3)', 'Polish', 'Rozumiem, nie chcę wchodzić w drogę Pana ogłoszeniu. Jeśli się nie sprzeda, czy byłaby ciekawa oferta za gotówkę?', 'Understood, I won''t step on your listing. If it doesn''t sell, would you want a cash offer then?', 'SP', 'Already Listed (ack then nurture)', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('already_listed', 'lc-v3m-al-vi-1', 'already_listed — Vietnamese (seller conversation v3)', 'Vietnamese', 'Tôi hiểu, tôi sẽ không làm ảnh hưởng đến việc rao bán của anh/chị. Nếu không bán được, anh/chị có muốn nhận một lời đề nghị trả tiền mặt không?', 'Understood, I won''t step on your listing. If it doesn''t sell, would you want a cash offer then?', 'SP', 'Already Listed (ack then nurture)', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('already_listed', 'lc-v3m-al-zh-1', 'already_listed — Mandarin (seller conversation v3)', 'Mandarin', '明白，我不会打扰您挂牌出售。如果没卖出去，您会考虑现金报价吗？', 'Understood, I won''t step on your listing. If it doesn''t sell, would you want a cash offer then?', 'SP', 'Already Listed (ack then nurture)', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('already_listed', 'lc-v3m-al-ko-1', 'already_listed — Korean (seller conversation v3)', 'Korean', '알겠습니다, 매물 진행에 방해되지 않게 하겠습니다. 혹시 팔리지 않으면 현금 제안을 받아 보시겠어요?', 'Understood, I won''t step on your listing. If it doesn''t sell, would you want a cash offer then?', 'SP', 'Already Listed (ack then nurture)', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('already_listed', 'lc-v3m-al-ja-1', 'already_listed — Japanese (seller conversation v3)', 'Japanese', '承知しました、売り出し中のお邪魔はしません。もし売れなかった場合、現金でのオファーはいかがですか？', 'Understood, I won''t step on your listing. If it doesn''t sell, would you want a cash offer then?', 'SP', 'Already Listed (ack then nurture)', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('already_listed', 'lc-v3m-al-he-1', 'already_listed — Hebrew (seller conversation v3)', 'Hebrew', 'הבנתי, לא אפריע למכירה שלך. אם הנכס לא יימכר, תרצה הצעה במזומן?', 'Understood, I won''t step on your listing. If it doesn''t sell, would you want a cash offer then?', 'SP', 'Already Listed (ack then nurture)', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('already_listed', 'lc-v3m-al-ar-1', 'already_listed — Arabic (seller conversation v3)', 'Arabic', 'فهمت، لن أتدخل في عرضك للبيع. إذا لم يُبع، هل تود عرضاً نقدياً حينها؟', 'Understood, I won''t step on your listing. If it doesn''t sell, would you want a cash offer then?', 'SP', 'Already Listed (ack then nurture)', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('already_listed', 'lc-v3m-al-ru-1', 'already_listed — Russian (seller conversation v3)', 'Russian', 'Понял, не буду мешать вашей продаже. Если не продастся, будет интересно предложение за наличные?', 'Understood, I won''t step on your listing. If it doesn''t sell, would you want a cash offer then?', 'SP', 'Already Listed (ack then nurture)', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('already_listed', 'lc-v3m-al-el-1', 'already_listed — Greek (seller conversation v3)', 'Greek', 'Κατάλαβα, δεν θα μπω στη μέση της αγγελίας σας. Αν δεν πουληθεί, θα σας ενδιέφερε μια προσφορά τοις μετρητοίς;', 'Understood, I won''t step on your listing. If it doesn''t sell, would you want a cash offer then?', 'SP', 'Already Listed (ack then nurture)', true, 'missing_language'),
  ('already_listed', 'lc-v3m-al-hi-1', 'already_listed — Indian (Hindi or Other) (seller conversation v3)', 'Indian (Hindi or Other)', 'समझ गया, मैं आपकी लिस्टिंग में दखल नहीं दूँगा। अगर यह नहीं बिकती, तो क्या आप कैश ऑफ़र चाहेंगे?', 'Understood, I won''t step on your listing. If it doesn''t sell, would you want a cash offer then?', 'SP', 'Already Listed (ack then nurture)', true, 'missing_language'),
